                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9759861b-2429-4804-a34b-3a2e24d5d292",
                                "sense_id": "0d7c93fe-e623-3480-a2e6-502b39a68fa6",
                                "text": "Dap. And will I tell then! By this hand of flesh,\nWould it might never write good courthand more,\nIf discover. What do you think of me,\nThat I am a chiaus?\n Face. What’s that?\n Dap. The Turk was, here―\nAs one would say, do you think I am a Turk?\n Face. I’ll tell the doctor so.\n Dap. Do, good sweet captain."
                            }
                        ]
